# Wave W17-U (Ruined Path): ruin wall — rubble-vault wall: dark fallen-stone bands carrying the collapse in the art itself — uneven strata, fallen-stone seams, and sparse pale glints struck through it where the design’s wall niches catch the dark (design: wall-niche glints drawn in the wall kind’s art, art layer only). The Ruined Path’s own wall — split from Copperbore Tunnel’s chalk-X inspection wall (Maris) by the missing lamp band: nobody inspects this wall; it fell, and the road kept working through it.
